<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves up FIM 172 Million in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves up FIM 172 Million in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to March 7 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to February 28  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 62,174	 62,002</p>
<p> Money market intervention    17,216	 12,104</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,256	  2,259</p>
<p> Total assets		     90,769	 85,399</p>
<p>In the previous week, to February 28, reserves rose by 117 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
